1. COUNT ORIGINS AND THE 12-LAYER
   U(n)=unrooted tournament classes, P(n)=rooted/node perspectives, SC(n)=self-converse classes.
   n  U(n)  P(n)  SC(n)  P(n-1)->U(n)  local_K_{n-1,n}_rect
