   sink-word slice in 5->6 extension                = 12
   self-converse classes at n=6                     = 12
   K_{4,5} rectangle cycle-space redundancy        = 12

2. ARITHMETIC CORRECTION
   48 + 12 is 60, not 56.
   The first defect is U(6)-P(5) = 56-48 = 8.
   The exact splice is U(6) = P(5) + U(5) - U(4) = 48+12-4 = 56.
   This identity is a useful alarm, not yet a theorem: the 4 is the previous
   parent/source layer that must be quotient-corrected when a source/sink
   slice is merged into the arbitrary rooted-perspective cache.
   Fractions of U(6): P(5)/U(6)=6/7, defect/U(6)=1/7, U(5)/U(6)=3/14, U(4)/U(6)=1/14.
   Hence the correction reads 1 = 6/7 + 3/14 - 1/14; the net missing mass is 1/7.

